{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QK8jYGeDuwsjvKaJPq7fJc","type":"tool_result","content":"# Multiple Choice Exam Interface - Content Summary\n\n## Topics Covered (Exact Quotes):\n\n**Navigation:**\n\"To navigate between items, click the Previous or Next button\"\n\n**Flagging Questions:**\n\"The candidate can 'Flag' an item for later review. This items will be highlighted on the 'Review Screen'\"\n\n**Review Screen:**\n\"When the candidate reaches the final multiple choice item, they will be prompted to click on 'Review Exam' the Review screen contains the 'Finish Exam' button.\"\n\n**Timer Information:**\n\"The timer indicates the testing time remaining.\"\n\"Requesting a break via the Pause Exam function will not stop the timer.\"\n\"The timer will not pause, and there is no way to ADD time back to the timer in the event of a system disconnect.\"\n\n**Exam Completion:**\n\"The Exam will end when the timer or expires, or when the candidate clicks 'Finish Exam'.\"\n\n## Topics NOT Mentioned:\n\n- Question count display\n- Question format specifications (single answer vs. multiple select)\n- Number of answer options per question\n- Unscored or pretest items\n- Time alerts/warnings\n- Changing answers after selection\n- Skipping questions\n\n**Screenshots Referenced:**\n- \"Multiple Choice ExamUI\"\n- \"Multiple Choice Review Screen\""}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d2102c50-dbf5-493b-ac44-9adf71c43c9f","uuid":"97ac6719-3546-456e-9fe0-7d9581cc4d7f","timestamp":"2026-08-31T23:56:49.557Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":1447,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# Multiple Choice Exam Interface - Content Summary\n\n## Topics Covered (Exact Quotes):\n\n**Navigation:**\n\"To navigate between items, click the Previous or Next button\"\n\n**Flagging Questions:**\n\"The candidate can 'Flag' an item for later review. This items will be highlighted on the 'Review Screen'\"\n\n**Review Screen:**\n\"When the candidate reaches the final multiple choice item, they will be prompted to click on 'Review Exam' the Review screen contains the 'Finish Exam' button.\"\n\n**Timer Information:**\n\"The timer indicates the testing time remaining.\"\n\"Requesting a break via the Pause Exam function will not stop the timer.\"\n\"The timer will not pause, and there is no way to ADD time back to the timer in the event of a system disconnect.\"\n\n**Exam Completion:**\n\"The Exam will end when the timer or expires, or when the candidate clicks 'Finish Exam'.\"\n\n## Topics NOT Mentioned:\n\n- Question count display\n- Question format specifications (single answer vs. multiple select)\n- Number of answer options per question\n- Unscored or pretest items\n- Time alerts/warnings\n- Changing answers after selection\n- Skipping questions\n\n**Screenshots Referenced:**\n- \"Multiple Choice ExamUI\"\n- \"Multiple Choice Review Screen\"","durationMs":4636,"url":"https://docs.linuxfoundation.org/tc-docs/certification/lf-handbook2/exam-user-interface/examui-multiple-choice-exams"}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014d9G5d9FmhGt7Pg53DBjfD","type":"tool_result","content":"# Summary of Exam User Interface Page\n\n## Exact Content Reproduction (Within 125-char limit)\n\nThe page header states: \"For the complete documentation index, see llms.txt. Markdown versions of documentation \npages are available by appending `.md`\"\n\n## Key Table Information\n\nThe page presents a two-column table categorizing exam codes by interface type:\n\n**Performance-Based Exams:** \"CKA CKAD CKS LFCS ICA CNPE\"\n\n**Multiple Choice Exams:** \"KCNA KCSA LFCA PCA RVFA FCFP FSOSD CGOA CCA CAPA CNPA CODE BCP KCA OTCA CBA\"\n\n## Child Pages/Links\n\nThe page links to exactly two subpages:\n\n1. **ExamUI for Performance Based Exams**\n   URL: `https://docs.linuxfoundation.org/tc-docs/certification/lf-handbook2/exam-user-interface/examui-performance-based-exams`\n\n2. **ExamUI for Multiple Choice Exams**\n   URL: `https://docs.linuxfoundation.org/tc-docs/certification/lf-handbook2/exam-user-interface/examui-multiple-choice-exams`\n\n## Important Limitation\n\n**Question navigation features are NOT mentioned** on this page. Details about timers, alerts, layout panels, navigation controls (skip, flag, review, back), or specific UI features are not included in the provided content—those details would be found on the linked subpages."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d2102c50-dbf5-493b-ac44-9adf71c43c9f","uuid":"8938a81e-0c62-4ca4-84bc-b08d3199c177","timestamp":"2026-08-31T23:56:51.929Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":1639,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# Summary of Exam User Interface Page\n\n## Exact Content Reproduction (Within 125-char limit)\n\nThe page header states: \"For the complete documentation index, see llms.txt. Markdown versions of documentation \npages are available by appending `.md`\"\n\n## Key Table Information\n\nThe page presents a two-column table categorizing exam codes by interface type:\n\n**Performance-Based Exams:** \"CKA CKAD CKS LFCS ICA CNPE\"\n\n**Multiple Choice Exams:** \"KCNA KCSA LFCA PCA RVFA FCFP FSOSD CGOA CCA CAPA CNPA CODE BCP KCA OTCA CBA\"\n\n## Child Pages/Links\n\nThe page links to exactly two subpages:\n\n1. **ExamUI for Performance Based Exams**\n   URL: `https://docs.linuxfoundation.org/tc-docs/certification/lf-handbook2/exam-user-interface/examui-performance-based-exams`\n\n2. **ExamUI for Multiple Choice Exams**\n   URL: `https://docs.linuxfoundation.org/tc-docs/certification/lf-handbook2/exam-user-interface/examui-multiple-choice-exams`\n\n## Important Limitation\n\n**Question navigation features are NOT mentioned** on this page. Details about timers, alerts, layout panels, navigation controls (skip, flag, review, back), or specific UI features are not included in the provided content—those details would be found on the linked subpages.","durationMs":4541,"url":"https://docs.linuxfoundation.org/tc-docs/certification/lf-handbook2/exam-user-interface"}}
